# Rust
target/
# Cargo.lock is committed deliberately: this repository builds wheels rather
# than publishing a library, so every build should resolve to the same
# dependency versions, and a dependency bump should arrive as a reviewable
# change rather than happening silently on whichever machine builds next.

# maturin / PyO3 built extension modules
*.so
